                                "sense_id": "fee57b5e-b9bd-39cd-81ce-aa0c48d8a844",
                                "text": "1970, Frank Straschitz, En Terre étrangère, 1999 ed., p. 70 (translated from English: Stranger in a Strange Land by Robert A. Heinlein)",
